---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /contact/
title: Contact and booking
description: Book a visit or ask a question. Call or WhatsApp Ryan on 07734 779429, or send me a message. Friendly tech help in Eastbourne and Bexhill.
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Give me a shout!</h1>
    <p class="lede">Call, WhatsApp, fill in the form or send a carrier pigeon (the form's quicker). {{ site.replyPromise }}</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container card-grid">
    <div class="card"><span class="card-icon">{% icon "phone" %}</span><h2 class="h3">Call</h2><p><a href="tel:{{ site.phoneLink }}">{{ site.phone }}</a><br><span class="small">{{ site.hours }}</span></p></div>
    <div class="card"><span class="card-icon">{% icon "message-circle" %}</span><h2 class="h3">WhatsApp</h2><p><a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}">Message me on WhatsApp</a><br><span class="small">Send a photo of the problem. Or the error message. Or the cat sat on the keyboard.</span></p></div>
    <div class="card"><span class="card-icon">{% icon "mail" %}</span><h2 class="h3">Email</h2><p><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p></div>
  </div>
</section>
{% include "partials/booking.njk" %}
